{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30112","headline":"赠敬晊助教二首 一 · 刘得仁","name":"赠敬晊助教二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到来常听说清虚，手把玄元七字书。\n仙籍不知名姓有，道情惟见往来疎。\n已能绝粒无饥色，早晚休官买隐居。\n便欲去随爲弟子，片云孤鹤可相於。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}